    "teach_2": {
      "id": "teach_2",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The cousin pattern is a sum:\n\n1/30 + 1/42 + 1/56 + 1/72 + 1/90 + 1/110\n\nLook at the bottoms: 30 = 5 × 6, 42 = 6 × 7, 56 = 7 × 8...",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_2_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_2_step": {
      "id": "teach_2_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Each term splits:\n\n1/(n(n + 1)) = 1/n − 1/(n + 1)\n\n1/30 = 1/5 − 1/6\n1/42 = 1/6 − 1/7\n1/56 = 1/7 − 1/8 ...",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_2_step2"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_2_step2": {
      "id": "teach_2_step2",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Add them and the middle cancels in pairs:\n\n1/5 − 1/6 + 1/6 − 1/7 + ... + 1/10 − 1/11\n= 1/5 − 1/11\n= 6/55\n\nFirst piece minus last piece. The middle is an illusion.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_2"
        }
      ]
    },
