      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "A quick one from the solved examples:\n\n99 49/50 × 10\n\nThe mixed number hides a beautiful rewrite:\n\n99 49/50 = 100 − 1/50",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
