      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Now multiply:\n\n(100 − 1/50) × 10\n= 1000 − 10/50\n= 1000 − 1/5\n= 999 4/5\n\nA mixed number near a round number is really a subtraction in disguise.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
