      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "One more exam format: a fixed recipe, applied in order.\n\nStep I: Multiply the number by 3 and add its square.\nStep II: Divide the result by 5 and add 6.\nStep III: Divide the result by 3, then square it.\n\nStart with 6.",
